    <briefdescription>
<para>End-to-end provenance and lineage tracker for training samples. </para>
    </briefdescription>
    <detaileddescription>
<para>Writes <computeroutput><ref refid="structthemis_1_1training_1_1_training_sample" kindref="compound">TrainingSample</ref></computeroutput> vertices and <computeroutput>DerivedFrom</computeroutput> edges to the AQL graph so that every accepted sample is traceable back to its source document. Integrates with <computeroutput>utils/audit_logger.cpp</computeroutput> to emit structured audit events for samples filtered out by the confidence threshold.</para>
<para>Example usage: <programlisting><codeline><highlight class="normal">ProvenanceTrackerConfig<sp/>cfg;</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal">cfg.graph_collection<sp/>=<sp/></highlight><highlight class="stringliteral">&quot;TrainingSamples&quot;</highlight><highlight class="normal">;</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal">cfg.emit_audit_events<sp/>=<sp/></highlight><highlight class="keyword">true</highlight><highlight class="normal">;</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal"></highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal"><ref refid="classthemis_1_1training_1_1_provenance_tracker_1aaf1126465c019e70590908cbaa6e946f" kindref="member">ProvenanceTracker</ref><sp/>tracker(cfg,<sp/></highlight><highlight class="stringliteral">&quot;arango://localhost:8529&quot;</highlight><highlight class="normal">);</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal"></highlight><highlight class="keyword">auto</highlight><highlight class="normal"><sp/>stats<sp/>=<sp/>tracker.write(records);</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal">std::cout<sp/>&lt;&lt;<sp/>stats.records_written<sp/>&lt;&lt;<sp/></highlight><highlight class="stringliteral">&quot;<sp/>provenance<sp/>records<sp/>written\n&quot;</highlight><highlight class="normal">;</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal"></highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal"></highlight><highlight class="comment">//<sp/>Trace<sp/>a<sp/>model<sp/>prediction<sp/>back<sp/>to<sp/>source<sp/>documents</highlight><highlight class="normal"></highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal"></highlight><highlight class="keyword">auto</highlight><highlight class="normal"><sp/>lineage<sp/>=<sp/>tracker.queryLineage(</highlight><highlight class="stringliteral">&quot;model_legal_v1&quot;</highlight><highlight class="normal">,<sp/>10);</highlight></codeline>
</programlisting> </para>
    </detaileddescription>
